- **`webACL.id()`**: This function call ensures that you're getting the correct `WebACL` element from the vector based on its index (`id=1`). If multiple elements exist with `id=1`, only one will be set as per the order they appear in the vector.

- **`set_requestMethod(std::string)`**: This method sets the specified field to the given value. In this case, we're setting it to `"GET"`.

Make sure you include necessary headers and namespace declarations at the beginning of your file to use these methods properly.

